            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This review describes peripheral use of cutting balloon (CB) angioplasty (CBA), its characteristics, and its distinction from conventional BA and describes the experimental and clinical background of its current use in peripheral arteries.</AbstractText>
